00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:41.521
And then they go on,

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:42.822
Jake, to describe

00:08:42.822 --> 00:08:44.590
all of the different ways

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:45.758
that they were trying to pressure

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:47.994
the former vice president, Mike Pence.

00:08:47.994 --> 00:08:50.663
They talk about the effort, obviously,

00:08:50.663 --> 00:08:52.265
to get those fake electors.

00:08:52.265 --> 00:08:55.001
This is all in support of the key charge,

00:08:55.301 --> 00:08:58.004
which is to to defraud

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.539
the United States, again,

00:08:59.539 --> 00:09:01.073
using the powers

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:02.074
of the Justice Department.

00:09:02.074 --> 00:09:02.742
This is where Jeffrey

00:09:02.742 --> 00:09:04.043
Clark comes into play.

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:05.077
They were trying to pressure

00:09:05.077 --> 00:09:07.179
the Justice Department to say

00:09:07.179 --> 00:09:10.917
that there was enough fraud to cause

00:09:10.917 --> 00:09:12.952
legislators, legislatures

00:09:12.952 --> 00:09:14.353
and state legislatures

00:09:14.353 --> 00:09:15.621
to discard

00:09:15.621 --> 00:09:16.889
their voting results

00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:19.158
and to try to seat their fake electors.

00:09:19.158 --> 00:09:22.762
And so all of this is is being wrapped up

00:09:23.095 --> 00:09:24.830
in one narrative

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.732
that the special counsel says,

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:28.734
explain why Donald Trump

00:09:28.968 --> 00:09:30.603
is being charged with

00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:32.972
the conspiracy

00:09:32.972 --> 00:09:34.173
to defraud the United States.

